# Elephant continuity

Use `elephant_command` for Elephant memorize, resume, help, status, history,
peek, note, doctor, usage, clean, pin, unpin, compact, and forget requests. Use
`elephant_recover` as a resume fallback. Compare recovered Git state with the
live worktree and continue without repeating completed work. Never invent a
previous session, add destructive confirmation, or ask the user to run a
terminal command for Elephant.
